SetMarketTest
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when market is zero address
    │   ├── when isSupported is true
    │   │   └── it should set market as supported and emit event
    │   └── when isSupported is false
    │       └── it should set market as unsupported and emit event
    └── when market is valid address
        ├── when isSupported is true
        │   └── it should set market as supported and emit event
        └── when isSupported is false
            └── it should set market as unsupported and emit event 